Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:10.50,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Which faction do you want to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:13.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Many ladies have recruited me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.77,0:00:17.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,but it's impossible for \Nme to choose just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:18.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Therefore...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:21.37,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm going to join all the factions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:22.25,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.12,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:30.94,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,And you think you're worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:32.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.95,0:00:38.04,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.02,0:00:43.27,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,You think you're worthy of joint\Nfaction membership?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.51,0:00:44.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:50.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But in order to be someone you wish \Nme to be, I shall give it my all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.74,0:00:54.78,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Then please prove your worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:57.53,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Coming from a man, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:00:59.22,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Please, Shilto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:02.54,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,He totally changes his reaction \Nbetween men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:05.54,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,We're going to test your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:07.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,For you, Miss Shilto,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.69,0:01:13.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can even pull off four consecutive\Nall-nighters, which my maid has banned!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.20,0:02:51.04,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE UNPRECEDENTED TROUBLEMAKER
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:49.02,main,STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Kunon Gurion's taking on the \Nthree factions in a magic battle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.20,main,STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,He's still new, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:53.15,main,STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,Why make a trainee like that do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:57.28,main,STUDENT 3,0,0,0,,But apparently this guy is the \Nstudent of Zeonly Finroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:02:59.98,main,STUDENT 4,0,0,0,,What?! He's Master Zeonly's student?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:01.53,main,STUDENT 5,0,0,0,,I've got to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:04.28,main,PROFESSOR 1,0,0,0,,Yes, I simply must see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.97,0:03:14.19,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I hope Kunon's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.57,0:03:17.63,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,If he gets hurt, Reyes \Ncan heal him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:20.97,main,REYES,0,0,0,,He brought it on himself, \Nbut I guess I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:27.98,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:30.60,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.93,0:03:37.73,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Causing such an uproar is what I'd \Nexpect from the student on Zeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.51,0:03:41.97,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to meet your \Nexpectations, Professor Sayfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:45.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If I win, how about we get a delicious\Nparfait at a café as a reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:48.85,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Do not hit on your professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.67,0:03:50.12,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.85,0:03:52.87,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,That's beautiful. Made of magic silver?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:55.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. It's my lucky charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:18.25,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Everyone's so intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:21.66,main,HANK,0,0,0,,They're the top sorcerers \Nin the advanced class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:22.74,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Especially...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.83,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Sandra. She's here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:27.99,main,HANK,0,0,0,,If she's in this, then I'm worried \Nabout the collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:29.39,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Collateral?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.39,0:04:32.42,main,HANK,0,0,0,,She's good at bold moves \Nbut sucks at control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:34.20,main,HANK,0,0,0,,She'll mow down everyone in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.20,0:04:35.25,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:39.46,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Somehow, I can't imagine \Nthat Kunon would lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.46,0:04:40.66,main,HANK,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.66,0:04:42.60,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I kind of get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:55.06,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,This is a quasi-barrier to \Nguard against attacking spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:05:00.59,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,The match is over when this magic \Ncircle is broken or someone yields.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:02.57,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Who wants to go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.10,0:05:04.20,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.20,0:05:06.26,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Why do you get to decide that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:07.56,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,I'm going first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:09.73,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Going by the order determined \Nby the representatives,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.73,0:05:11.15,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Ability should go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:13.20,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,I don't think that matters anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.45,0:05:15.96,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,That's right! Stay out of this, uggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:17.96,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,I'm not ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.41,0:05:23.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please don't fight over me, \Nmy beautiful fairies and the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.21,0:05:25.72,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,You're the cause of all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.97,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Are you referring to \Nme as "the other one"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:30.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can take you all on at once, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:31.24,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:31.87,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:32.29,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:33.22,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:37.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm confident I can win regardless \Nof how many come at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:39.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If it's the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:40.30,main,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:41.77,main,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Did he just say all at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.77,0:05:42.77,main,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,That's crazy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:44.90,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Did he say four of them at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:47.45,main,HANK,0,0,0,,What is Kunon thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:50.31,main,REYES,0,0,0,,As long as he doesn't die,\N it's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.31,0:05:52.06,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I can heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:05:59.21,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Here's the roster of \Nthe factions this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.59,0:06:02.92,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,There may be some changes later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:05.86,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:11.35,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Actually, a first-year student seems \Nto be causing a commotion about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.83,0:06:16.21,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,That brat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.86,0:06:19.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:20.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:24.73,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,He's so cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:26.74,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Are you really sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:27.74,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:31.49,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Cocky, cocky, cocky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.49,0:06:34.62,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,You shouldn't provoke them, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:37.12,main,HANK,0,0,0,,How is he planning to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.73,0:06:41.13,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,What? He has to break \Nthat magic circle, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:45.51,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I don't believe he's \Nlearned any attack spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:47.13,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.95,0:06:55.58,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Please begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:02.40,main - italics,CASSIS/I,0,0,0,,He's only got two \Nelementary spells, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:06.40,main - italics,ELIA/I,0,0,0,,He's Zeonly's student, huh? Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:09.15,main - italics,ELVA/I,0,0,0,,What is he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:11.91,main - italics,SANDRA/I,0,0,0,,I guess I'll wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:15.28,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:21.54,main - italics,CASSIS/I,0,0,0,,And it's a very basic one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:22.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:28.80,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:34.68,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:39.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:40.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.61,0:07:41.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:42.56,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Multiply.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:43.81,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Color.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.19,0:07:49.24,main,HANK,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:52.39,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,The red fog he used \Nagainst Professor Soff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.31,0:08:04.73,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:06.46,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,This is A-ori, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.21,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,It's clinging to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:14.47,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get my clothes dirty! \NI love this outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:16.97,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Calm down! It's just fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:20.85,main - italics,SANDRA/I,0,0,0,,He's obscuring our sight so he can attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:30.76,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.58,0:08:36.52,main - italics,SANDRA/I,0,0,0,,Coloring it must be a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:39.37,main - italics,SANDRA/I,0,0,0,,It's a basic water spell, A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.37,0:08:41.56,main - italics,SANDRA/I,0,0,0,,It's only water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.47,0:08:45.37,main - italics,SANDRA/I,0,0,0,,I was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:48.92,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,It's my turn now! Just you watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.64,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Ew, I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.04,0:08:59.64,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,Is this... slime?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.82,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,You got me! I yield!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.27,0:09:14.91,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,We lose, Kunon Gurion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.71,0:09:16.66,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:18.71,main,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Huh? It's over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.71,0:09:20.41,main,STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Just because it rained?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:24.15,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Why didn't they counterattack?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:27.64,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,They lost on purpose \Nbecause they wanted Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:29.29,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.29,0:09:33.57,main,HANK,0,0,0,,In the name of their factions, \Nthey wouldn't dare lose to a first-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:34.73,main,REYES,0,0,0,,That magic circle...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:38.53,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Why use the quasi-barrier?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.53,0:09:42.43,main,REYES,0,0,0,,The rain obviously passed \Nthrough the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:49.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I passed the test, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:00.07,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,You didn't hold back, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:01.45,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Who's going to clean this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:03.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.69,0:10:05.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It'll disappear when I release it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.07,0:10:15.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you all right, my beautiful mermaids?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:16.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:19.76,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Here's my apology for making you cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:22.60,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Think of this as the warmth of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:24.26,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,It's warm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:28.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:29.95,main,SANDRA,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.05,0:10:35.03,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Would you like one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:47.54,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,So what was that red rain, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:50.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Well, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:53.54,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:55.68,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's sticky water!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:59.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You know, it's like slime rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:01.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, the color is irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:03.80,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It just needed to be distinguishable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.04,0:11:07.78,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,If you're showered with it,\N a counterattack is out of question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:10.51,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,It gets in your mouth, \Nso you can't chant a spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:11.81,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Let alone breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.06,0:11:16.57,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,So Sandra and the others \Nwere right to admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:22.82,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Then why didn't that magic \Ncircle repel your attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:28.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What I used was not an\N attack spell, but an elementary A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:32.20,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,The amount of magical \Npower used was too small?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:36.71,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,So it didn't recognize it as\N an attack, and it let it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:40.21,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,You knew the properties\N of the magic circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:46.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I've done magic battles with that \Nmagic circle many times with my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:49.35,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,With Zeonly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:52.98,main - flashback,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,No need to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.34,0:11:55.71,main - flashback,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,Hit me with everything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:58.98,main - flashback,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,I'll teach you the depth of earth magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.25,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll try!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:02.36,main - flashback,ZEONLY,0,0,0,,All right, bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.11,0:12:15.00,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,{\i1}The{\i0} Zeonly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.10,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,...lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:18.13,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:20.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I cannot lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:23.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I only won the first battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:27.26,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and after the second time, he'd hit me\N preemptively and I kept losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.78,0:12:30.36,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,So, if you wait and see, you lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:32.77,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,It's nastier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:35.99,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,No one can beat you in the first battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:38.02,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,So that's what you meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.31,0:12:43.40,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,We'll allow your joint membership.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:51.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes! Now I can spend my school life \Nwith you without anyone interfering.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:54.44,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Just thinking about that makes \Nmy heart soar until dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:13:00.80,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure three self-nominated\N joint memberships is unheard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.14,0:13:04.19,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,We've got someone truly out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.35,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Before joining the factions,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.35,0:13:16.06,main,SIGN,0,0,0,,you should talk to the seniors\Nyou embarrassed in front of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:21.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. As a gentleman, I'd love to \Nget to know those three ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:22.48,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,And another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:24.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You mean Cassis?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:27.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd happily invite ladies any day, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:29.45,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Well, the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.28,0:13:39.61,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The heart... of a maiden?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:49.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The heart of a maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:51.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The heart of a maiden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.49,0:13:55.54,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Who knew there was a man... \Nno, a woman like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:13:59.72,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.11,0:14:02.68,main,HANK,0,0,0,,What happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:04.67,main,HANK,0,0,0,,What was that red rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:07.83,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,The whole school is talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.83,0:14:10.37,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Did you solve the issue \Nwith the factions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:14.42,main,HANK,0,0,0,,They approved joint membership?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:16.34,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,That's amazing, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:18.75,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I still have a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:24.00,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I am so ashamed of my \Nungentlemanly behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:31.03,main,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I can't look Her Highness in the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:43.15,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Hey, Mirika!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:45.14,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.14,0:14:46.39,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,You'd better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.81,0:14:51.03,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I told you I'd be fine \Nby myself, Brother Lyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:53.47,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,It's a big day for the vice captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:56.29,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,It's only natural I watch over \Nit as the captain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:00.79,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,How are you, Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:04.47,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,Today, I'm finally taking the exam \Nfor the knighthood department
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.47,0:15:05.80,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,at the senior school for nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:08.42,main,JUDGE,0,0,0,,Next! Mirika Hughlia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:09.31,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:21.91,main,JUDGE,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:49.17,main,LYLE,0,0,0,,There you go. That's my vice captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:50.57,main,JUDGE,0,0,0,,Match over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.57,0:15:52.05,main,JUDGE,0,0,0,,Mirika Hughlia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.21,0:15:56.06,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,I will become a woman worthy of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.57,0:16:00.30,main - italics,MIRIKA/I,0,0,0,,So please do your best \Nat the magic school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:05.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:08.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Her Highness, in the \Nknighthood department?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:12.89,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon! It's getting cold,\N so let's head inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.63,0:16:16.78,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Master Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:18.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:20.01,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,It's time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.01,0:16:21.50,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:25.45,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Shall I bring you a fresh warm one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.45,0:16:26.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:27.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:30.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'll drink it at night, \Nso take it to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.68,0:16:34.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,It's the milk tea you \Nmake for me with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.55,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:37.53,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,There's no tea in it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:41.48,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Rinko. Do you ever cut \Nyourself with a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:44.31,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,I'm a pro, so I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:46.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I see. Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:49.08,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:51.65,main,RINKO,0,0,0,,You're awfully kind today, Master Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:55.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm always kind,\N because I'm a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:18.02,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,My dear fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:20.33,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:24.89,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I suppose I should congratulate you on \Nenrolling in the knighthood department
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:27.82,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,at the senior school for nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:32.13,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,But I'm very worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:35.74,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,You must be training hard every day, \Nlike your life depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.31,0:17:38.49,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,There may be times when you get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:44.50,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I want to support you and cheer for you, \Nbut I do not wish to see you suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.22,0:17:49.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Well, not that I can really see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:22.37,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Please, please, do not \Npush yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:24.71,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,I will write to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:27.81,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Again and again, many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:30.50,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Please don't forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:35.58,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Not a day goes by when \NI don't think about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:49.33,main - italics,KUNON/I,0,0,0,,Your Kunon Gurion, with eternal love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:33.96,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,He's thinking of me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.43,0:20:35.46,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.97,0:20:40.02,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I've grown so strong that even \Na bear can't scare me away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:42.69,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,When you come back, you'll be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:45.10,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,How could I forget about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.10,0:20:49.06,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,I'm always thinking about you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:52.22,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,"With eternal love," oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:21:02.17,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,"P.S., I've made a few dozen \Nmore female friends at school."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:04.86,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Isn't that a lot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.42,0:21:10.38,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,"I've encountered a mysterious \Nlady with the heart of a maiden."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.38,0:21:12.42,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,"I intend to learn about more ladies
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:17.38,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,and become a gentleman who \Nis worthy of Your Highness."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.74,0:21:23.63,main,MIRIKA,0,0,0,,K-Kunon! You don't have to \Nwork too hard on that front!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.63,0:21:27.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning, sea birds \Nplaying in the shallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.13,0:21:32.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I just know that I was \Nborn to heal your hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:35.13,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Hey, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.13,0:21:36.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Cassis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:40.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,As an apology for my rude behavior,\NI'd like to invite you to lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.84,0:21:45.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,and the gentleman in me is jumping\Nas if to dance so early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.55,0:21:48.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Please accept my invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:49.34,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.34,0:21:51.23,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,I'm the type to hold grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:53.70,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,I only came because the \Nrepresentative told me to!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:55.16,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:59.67,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Mr. Bael wants you to join him \Nin developing a magic tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:01.40,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:05.84,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I will dedicate the knowledge of magic \Ntools I learned from my master to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.84,0:22:08.37,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Hey, now! I was here first!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.37,0:22:09.64,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Get lost, you uggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.64,0:22:11.22,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,I'm not ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.60,0:22:16.76,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,As an earth sorcerer, \NI'm interested in Zeonly's knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.76,0:22:18.91,main,ELVA,0,0,0,,Will you share it with me as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.91,0:22:20.23,main,SANRDA,0,0,0,,Hey, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.23,0:22:22.89,main,SANRDA,0,0,0,,Fight me one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.89,0:22:25.23,main,SANRDA,0,0,0,,I'm not going to lose this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.23,0:22:27.74,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Oh, shut it, shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.74,0:22:28.82,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.82,0:22:30.95,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Ugly mugs, you all need to get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.43,0:22:33.74,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,What a mess...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.74,0:22:36.63,main,HANK,0,0,0,,It's impossible to join \Nthree factions, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.62,0:22:43.79,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I'm going to make pills of shi-shilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.79,0:22:45.76,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Do you want to write a report on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.99,0:22:48.23,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Of course I do, Miss Reyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.32,0:22:55.45,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,It seems Kunon joined all three factions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.96,0:22:57.64,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,It's unprecedented.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:01.33,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,The first troublemaker since Zeonly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.85,0:23:04.63,main,GRAY,0,0,0,,I highly welcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.66,0:23:10.06,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,So, I'm going on a search for a \Nshipwreck with the representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.06,0:23:11.65,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,You interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:13.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A shipwreck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.64,0:23:15.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I would love to come along!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.79,0:23:19.57,main,CASSIS,0,0,0,,Weigh anchor! Set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.95,0:23:36.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I can't suppress my curiosity!
